{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026pfoCTnUKEA1793091454.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>網上流傳一段車Cam片段，事發時有一位男途人正沿行人過路處過馬路，見「綠色人像」燈號閃動，遂加快步伐提速橫過，不料突然有一名騎着疑似電動單車的人士無視交通燈號，在紅燈下竟然高速疾馳衝過，險些直接撞上該名男途人。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-27-16h21m21s840.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026QnGNVQaGt61793090218.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-27-16h21m16s771.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026W31M27TNM21793090230.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>這幕「近距離閃避」的驚險畫面讓不少人捏一把汗，上載影片的網民事後留言感嘆：「依條友真係要還神😎只差一點點」，並指涉事者「見到紅燈照衝，根本唔會理人」。</p><p></p><p>事件隨即引爆網民熱議，大批網民紛紛批評現時電動單車的違規亂象，指情況相當嚴重，留言直呼：「黐X線！」、「大地任佢行」、「真係只差一點點！」</p><p> </p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T01:41:01.083608+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":251,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T01:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T12:58:25.024872+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T01:38:25.072482+00:00","content_hash":"5bd0c39f6cd7611ea16c73c6e6dce56167a1724333e93cafcab1096dc5379e5e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T01:41:01.083608+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}